os%2Fvisma.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Flogos%2Fvisma.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75"/></div><div class="flex justify-center items-center max-md:hidden max-lg:hidden"><img alt="Posh VIP Logo" loading="lazy" width="200" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="col-span-2 sm:max-h-12 w-full object-contain lg:col-span-1 grayscale opacity-50 px-7 sm:px-6 md:px-2 py-4 md:py-2" style="color:transparent" src="/logos/poshvip.svg"/></div><div class="flex justify-center items-center max-md:hidden"><img alt="Netflix Logo" loading="lazy" width="200" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="col-span-2 sm:max-h-12 w-full object-contain lg:col-span-1 grayscale opacity-50 px-7 sm:px-6 md:px-2 py-4 md:py-2" style="color:transparent" src="/logos/netflix.svg"/></div><div class="flex justify-center items-center max-md:hidden"><img alt="Siemens Logo" loading="lazy" width="200" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="col-span-2 sm:max-h-12 w-full object-contain lg:col-span-1 grayscale opacity-90 px-7 sm:px-6 md:px-2 py-4 md:py-2" style="color:transparent" src="/logos/simens.svg"/></div></div></div></section><section class="relative"><div class="absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 pointer-events-none -mt-20 -z-10" aria-hidden="true"><img alt="Illustration" loading="lazy" width="1440" height="440" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="max-w-none" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/features-illustration.22b37d34.svg"/></div><section class="relative"><div class="absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 pointer-events-none -mt-20 -z-10" aria-hidden="true"><img alt="Illustration" loading="lazy" width="1440" height="440" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="max-w-none" style="color:transparent" src="/_next/static/media/features-illustration.22b37d34.svg"/></div><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 border-t border-slate-300"><div class="py-6 sm:py-24" id="how-it-works"><div class="pb-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-4 flex sm:justify-center"><div class="text-center max-w-5xl"><h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-recoleta mb-6 text-gray-900 font-semibold">How to capture and share beautiful screenshots</h2></div></div><div class="max-w-8xl mx-auto p-2 md:p-6 mt-2 mb-24 rounded-xl backdrop-blur-xs bg-white/30 border" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="300"><div class="mx-auto mt-1 sm:justify-center relative"><div style="position:relative;padding-bottom:calc(57.67989417989418% + 42px);height:0"><iframe title="Supa Screenshot Interactive Demo" class="rounded overflow-hidden" src="https://app.supademo.com/embed/clvcyoqo2630uho9tz3gk0luq" allowfullscreen="" style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%"></iframe></div></div></div><div><div class="mx-auto max-w-8xl px-2 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="text-left md:mx-auto md:grid sm:max-w-5xl sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-8"><div class="flex flex-col mb-4"><div class="flex justify-left mb-4"><div class="rounded-xl p-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-indigo-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" width="30" height="30" class="text-blue-100"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 15.75l5.159-5.159a2.25 2.25 0 013.182 0l5.159 5.159m-1.5-1.5l1.409-1.409a2.25 2.25 0 013.182 0l2.909 2.909m-18 3.75h16.5a1.5 1.5 0 001.5-1.5V6a1.5 1.5 0 00-1.5-1.5H3.75A1.5 1.5 0 002.25 6v12a1.5 1.5 0 001.5 1.5zm10.5-11.25h.008v.008h-.008V8.25zm.375 0a.375.375 0 11-.75 0 .375.375 0 01.75 0z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="order-2 mt-2 leading-6 text-gray-600"> Open the <a class="underline hover:text-indigo-500" href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/supademo-ai-interactive-d/jblbcpkejogbghfdglhfjlplchcnmohm">extension</a> to capture a browser window or use <code class="bg-slate-100 border text-sm py-1 px-1.5 rounded shadow hover:shadow-none cursor-pointer">⌘ + shift + 9</code> to quickly snap a screenshot.</div><div class="order-1 text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-700 font-inter font-semibold">Capture screenshot </div></div><div class="flex flex-col mb-4"><div class="flex justify-left mb-4"><div class="rounded-xl p-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-indigo-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" width="30" height="30" class="text-blue-100"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.53 16.122a3 3 0 00-5.78 1.128 2.25 2.25 0 01-2.4 2.245 4.5 4.5 0 008.4-2.245c0-.399-.078-.78-.22-1.128zm0 0a15.998 15.998 0 003.388-1.62m-5.043-.025a15.994 15.994 0 011.622-3.395m3.42 3.42a15.995 15.995 0 004.764-4.648l3.876-5.814a1.151 1.151 0 00-1.597-1.597L14.146 6.32a15.996 15.996 0 00-4.649 4.763m3.42 3.42a6.776 6.776 0 00-3.42-3.42"></path></svg></div></div><div class="order-2 mt-2 leading-6 text-gray-600"> Use the built-in editor to crop, annotate, blur or beautify your screenshot in seconds. </div><div class="order-1 text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-700 font-inter font-semibold">Annotate and beautify </div></div><div class="flex flex-col mb-4"><div class="flex justify-left mb-4"><div class="rounded-xl p-4 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-indigo-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" width="30" height="30" class="text-blue-100"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M7.217 10.907a2.25 2.25 0 100 2.186m0-2.186c.18.324.283.696.283 1.093s-.103.77-.283 1.093m0-2.186l9.566-5.314m-9.566 7.5l9.566 5.314m0 0a2.25 2.25 0 103.935 2.186 2.25 2.25 0 00-3.935-2.186zm0-12.814a2.25 2.25 0 103.933-2.185 2.25 2.25 0 00-3.933 2.185z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="order-2 mt-2 leading-6 text-gray-600"> Copy to your clipboard with <code class="bg-slate-100 border text-xs py-1 px-1.5 rounded shadow hover:shadow-none cursor-pointer">⌘ + C</code>, download with <code class="bg-slate-100 border text-xs py-1 px-1.5 rounded shadow hover:shadow-none cursor-pointer">⌘ + X</code>, share as a link, or add it to an existing Supademo. </div><div class="order-1 text-xl font-medium tracking-tight text-gray-700 font-inter font-semibold">Copy, save or share as a link </div></div></div></div></div><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center py-8"><div class="max-w-xs mx-auto sm:max-w-none sm:inline-flex sm:justify-center space-y-4 sm:space-y-0 sm:space-x-4 mt-5 md:mt-8" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200"><div><a class="px-6 py-3 font-medium inline-flex items-center justify-center border border-transparent rounded leading-snug transition duration-150 ease-in-out text-slate-100 bg-indigo-500 hover:bg-indigo-700 w-full shadow-sm group rounded-lg" href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/supademo-ai-interactive-d/jblbcpkejogbghfdglhfjlplchcnmohm"><img alt="Close logo" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="max-w-xs mr-2 rounded" style="color:transparent" src="/../images/chrome-store.svg"/>Download free extension<!-- --> <span class="tracking-normal text-slate-100 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform duration-150 ease-in-out ml-2">→</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="max-w-8xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 border-t border-slate-300"><div class="py-12 sm:py-24" id="screen-recording"><div class="pb-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-2 sm:px-4 flex sm:justify-start"><div class="text-left max-w-5xl"><div class="mb-8"><span class="text-sm sm:text-md text-slate-800 font-semibold bg-slate-50 bg-opacity-50 px-4 py-3 rounded-full border-2 border-slate-300 border-opacity-50">Create Beautiful Product Screenshots Easily</span></div><h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl font-recoleta mb-4 text-gray-900">Create <span class="italic">unlimited</span> screenshots for free</h2><p class="text-gray-700 sm:text-lg md:mt-4 md:max-w-3xl">Say goodbye to dealing with multiple annotation tools, file constraints, and cluttered desktops full of screenshots.</p></div></div><div><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 group"><div class="md:col-span-6 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl bg-slate-50/50" data-aos="fade-down"><div class="relative h-full relative h-full backdrop-blur-xs bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-100 rounded-xl z-20 overflow-hidden"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="md:max-w-[480px] shrink-0 order-1 md:order-none p-6 pt-0 md:p-8"><div><h3 class="inline-flex text-xl font-bold text-slate-700 pb-1">Full-screen or selected area screenshots</h3><p class="text-slate-500">Capture the entire browser or drag across a chosen area to capture specific content on the screen.</p></div></div><div class="mb-6 relative w-full h-60 md:h-auto overflow-hidden contain"><img alt="Supa screenshot feature 1" loading="lazy" width="480" height="230" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 mx-auto max-w-full md:relative md:left-0 md:translate-x-0" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Fsupa-screenshot-min.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Fsupa-screenshot-min.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Fsupa-screenshot-min.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div><div class="md:col-span-6 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl bg-slate-50/50" data-aos="fade-down"><div class="relative h-full relative h-full backdrop-blur-xs bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-100 rounded-xl z-20 overflow-hidden"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="md:max-w-[480px] shrink-0 order-1 md:order-none p-6 pt-0 md:p-8"><div><h3 class="inline-flex text-xl font-bold text-slate-700 pb-1">Delayed screenshot capture</h3><p class="text-slate-500">Capture modals, menu items, or time-sensitive assets by delaying the screenshot capture by 3 seconds.</p></div></div><div class="mb-6 relative w-full h-60 md:h-auto overflow-hidden"><img alt="Supa screenshot feature 2" loading="lazy" width="480" height="230" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 mx-auto max-w-full md:relative md:left-0 md:translate-x-0" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Fsupa-screenshot-2-min.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Fsupa-screenshot-2-min.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Fsupa-screenshot-2-min.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative"><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 border-t border-slate-300"><div class="py-12" id="editing"><div class="pb-8 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-2 sm:px-4 flex sm:justify-start"><div class="text-left max-w-5xl"><div class="mb-8"><span class="text-sm sm:text-md text-slate-800 font-semibold bg-slate-50 bg-opacity-50 px-4 py-3 rounded-full border-2 border-slate-300 border-opacity-50">Powerful Online Screenshot Editor</span></div><h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold sm:text-4xl font-recoleta mb-4 text-gray-900">Edit, markup, and share in seconds</h2><p class="text-gray-700 sm:text-lg md:mt-4 md:max-w-3xl">Save time and effort with an all-in-one tool for creating beautifully annotated screenshots.</p></div></div><div class="relative pb-12 md:pb-20"><div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 group"><div class="md:col-span-5 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl bg-slate-50/50" data-aos="fade-down"><div class="relative h-full relative h-full backdrop-blur-xs bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-100 rounded-xl z-20 overflow-hidden"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="md:max-w-[480px] shrink-0 order-1 md:order-none p-6 md:p-8"><div><h3 class="inline-flex text-xl font-bold text-slate-700 pb-1">Copy to clipboard or share URL</h3><p class="text-slate-500">Instantly copy and paste screenshots or store in the cloud as a shareable URL link.</p></div></div><div class="mb-6 md:mb-0 relative w-full h-64 md:h-auto overflow-hidden contain"><img alt="Supa screenshot share" loading="lazy" width="400" height="220" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 mx-auto max-w-full md:relative md:left-0 md:translate-x-0 rounded-xl" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Fph-2.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Fph-2.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Fph-2.avif&amp;w=828&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div><div class="md:col-span-7 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl bg-slate-50/50" data-aos="fade-down"><div class="relative h-full relative h-full backdrop-blur-xs bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-100 rounded-xl z-20 overflow-hidden"><div class="flex flex-col"><div class="md:max-w-[480px] shrink-0 order-1 md:order-none p-6 md:p-8"><div><h3 class="inline-flex text-xl font-bold text-slate-700 pb-1">Blur, crop and beautify</h3><p class="text-slate-500">Blur sensitive data directly within the editor. Crop, add text, or annotate with callouts and pointers.</p></div></div><div class="mb-6 md:mb-0 relative w-full h-64 md:h-auto overflow-hidden"><img alt="Supa screenshot annotate" loading="lazy" width="575" height="230" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 mx-auto max-w-full md:relative md:left-0 md:translate-x-0" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Fph-1.avif&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Fph-1.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Ffeatures%2Fph-1.avif&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div><div class="md:col-span-12 border border-slate-200 rounded-xl bg-slate-50/50" data-aos="fade-down"><div class="relative h-full backdrop-blur-xs bg-gradient-to-b from-white to-slate-100 rounded-xl z-20 overflow-hidden"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between"><div class="md:max-w-[480px] shrink-0 order-1 md:order-none p-6 md:p-8 md:pr-0"><div class="mb-5"><div><h3 class="inline-flex text-xl font-bold text-slate-700 pb-1">Add to any Supademo</h3><p class="text-slate-500">Quickly take screenshots and add it to an existing Supademo in just a few clicks – making your existing interactive demos much more maintainable.</p></div></div></div><div class="mb-6 md:mb-0 relative w-full h-64 md:h-auto overflow-hidden pt-2 px-2"><img alt="Company branding" loading="lazy" width="604" height="400" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 mx-auto max-w-full md:relative md:left-0{md}transla{}-x-0" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexample1.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 1x, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexample1.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 2x" src="/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fexample1.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section><div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"><div class="py-12 md:py-20"><div class="bg-transparent"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl divide-y divide-gray-900/10"><h2 class="text-2xl font-inter text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl mb-6 text-center font-bold">Frequently asked questions</h2><div class="mt-12 space-y-6 divide-y divide-gray-900/10"><details class="border-t border-gray-50 pt-6"><summary class="font-medium cursor-pointer [&amp;::marker]:text-gray-300">How can I create beautiful screenshots?</summary><p class="text-base leading-7 text-gray-800 text-sm my-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50">To create screenshots with beautiful backgrounds, simply (1) snap a screenshot instantly using Supademo&#x27;s free screenshot extension or upload your own to the online image editor. (2) Then enhance your screenshot with annotations, blur, or beautiful backgrounds. (3) Finally, share your beautiful screenshot as a download, clipboard copy, or as a public share link.</p></details><details class="border-t border-gray-50 pt-6"><summary class="font-medium cursor-pointer [&amp;::marker]:text-gray-300">What are product screenshots and how can they benefit my business?</summary><p class="text-base leading-7 text-gray-800 text-sm my-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50">Product screenshots are static images that highlight key features or designs of your product. They are essential for showcasing your product&#x27;s interface or design to potential customers, helping to convey its value and functionality effectively.</p></details><details class="border-t border-gray-50 pt-6"><summary class="font-medium cursor-pointer [&amp;::marker]:text-gray-300">What are some use cases for beautifying my product screenshots?</summary><p class="text-base leading-7 text-gray-800 text-sm my-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50">Adding a beautiful background to your existing screenshot can be helpful when you&#x27;re using it for external-facing collateral like product updates, changelogs, support docs, or training guides. While we typically recommend using interactive product demos for more complex illustrations, screenshots are a great way to portray features or workflow that are simple and may not warrant the use of a full-fledged demo.</p></details><details class="border-t border-gray-50 pt-6"><summary class="font-medium cursor-pointer [&amp;::marker]:text-gray-300">How do I share screenshots quickly and efficiently?</summary><p class="text-base leading-7 text-gray-800 text-sm my-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50">You can share screenshots quickly by using Supademo&#x27;s Chrome extension or screenshot uploader. Through these free tools, you can capture screenshots for free, or upload your own images to instantly generate a shareable link with others for easy access.</p></details><details class="border-t border-gray-50 pt-6"><summary class="font-medium cursor-pointer [&amp;::marker]:text-gray-300">Can I also annotate, redact or blur elements of my screenshot?</summary><p class="text-base leading-7 text-gray-800 text-sm my-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50">Yes - you can use Supademo to quickly annotate your screenshot with text, arrows, or shapes. You can also blur or redact any sensitive information like names or emails in just a few clicks.</p></details><details class="border-t border-gray-50 pt-6"><summary class="font-medium cursor-pointer [&amp;::marker]:text-gray-300">How can I beautify my product screenshot before sharing it?</summary><p class="text-base leading-7 text-gray-800 text-sm my-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50">Simply use our built-in background tool to add an elegant background to your new or existing product screenshot. Then proceed to crop, annotate, or edit. You can then share the beautiful screenshot by copying it to your clipboard, downloading, or sharing as a public link.</p></details><details class="border-t border-gray-50 pt-6"><summary class="font-medium cursor-pointer [&amp;::marker]:text-gray-300">Is Supademo&#x27;s beautiful screenshot tool free to use?</summary><p class="text-base leading-7 text-gray-800 text-sm my-2 p-4 rounded-xl bg-slate-50">Yes - our beautiful screenshot tool is free to use. This includes the free screenshot capture extension and the ability to edit new and existing screenshots for free using our online editor.</p></details></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto p-2 md:p-2 mt-2 mb-8 rounded-3xl backdrop-blur-xs bg-indigo-800/10 border"><div class="py-12 sm:space-y-8 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-900 border border-slate-200/50"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-left mb-8 px-8"><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-inter font-bold text-white">More Free Tools</h2><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 md:gap-4 pt-8"><a class="flex flex-col px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-100 hover:bg-indigo-50 font-medium md:text-sm" href="/tools/prototype-maker">Clickable Prototype Maker</a><a class="flex flex-col px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-100 hover:bg-indigo-50 font-medium md:text-sm" href="/tools/interactive-presentation-builder">Interactive Presentation Builder</a><a class="flex flex-col px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-100 